@startuml
title Cost Center Routes

actor Client
participant "CostCenterResource" as Resource
participant "CostCenterCatalog" as Catalog

== GET /api/cost-center ==
Client -> Resource: GET /api/cost-center
activate Resource
Resource -> Catalog: list()
activate Catalog
Catalog --> Resource: List<MonetaryCenter>
deactivate Catalog
Resource --> Client: 200 OK (List<MonetaryCenter>)
deactivate Resource
@enduml
